{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29153","headline":"酬和杜侍御 · 许浑","name":"酬和杜侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花时曾省杜陵游，闻下书帷不举头。\n因过石城先访戴，欲朝金阙暂依刘。\n征帆夜转鸬鷀穴，骋骑春辞鹳雀楼。\n正把新诗望南浦，棹歌应是木兰舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}